  "notes": "Part of the Hidden Disney 2026 Wave A Ear Headbands set (7 pins), first available 12 January 2026 via cast-member trading, with mystery pouches following in spring 2026 — chasers and super chasers are pouch-only. CONTRADICTION IN SOURCES on which resort: DisneyPinsBlog's 2026 Wave A round-up puts an Ear Headbands set featuring Maleficent, Figment, Zazu, Star Tours and Jasmine with a Jaq & Gus chaser and a Hatbox Ghost super chaser in the Disneyland collection, while Pin & Pop's DLR 2026 Wave A Ear Headbands series lists Snow White, Evil Queen, a Sleeping Beauty chaser and a Madame Leota super chaser instead. The likeliest reading is that WDW and DLR each got their own 2026 Ear Headbands set and the blog conflated them (Figment is an EPCOT character), but I could not verify this — treat the resort attribution on this record as unconfirmed. Disney Pinventory catalogs the Hatbox Ghost super chaser as item 49522. No single-pin retail price: Hidden Disney pins are not sold individually.",
